	'Text included when sharing this {postType}. Use {title} and {url} as placeholders.' => __( 'Text included when sharing this {postType}. Use {title} and {url} as placeholders.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The Breadcrumb trail and Back Button show up when a visitor reaches a Gallery from this Album. On direct visits to a Gallery they only appear if "Show Breadcrumbs on Direct Visits" is enabled AND that Gallery belongs to this Album only. If a Gallery is assigned to two or more Albums there is no single parent to point back to, so nothing is rendered on direct visits regardless of that setting.' => __( 'The Breadcrumb trail and Back Button show up when a visitor reaches a Gallery from this Album. On direct visits to a Gallery they only appear if "Show Breadcrumbs on Direct Visits" is enabled AND that Gallery belongs to this Album only. If a Gallery is assigned to two or more Albums there is no single parent to point back to, so nothing is rendered on direct visits regardless of that setting.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The FotoGrids cache, which you turn on and off per {postType.lower} under <strong>Performance</strong>. And your site\'s page cache - a caching plugin, your host, or a CDN - which FotoGrids can ask to skip a page but cannot control.' => __( 'The FotoGrids cache, which you turn on and off per {postType.lower} under <strong>Performance</strong>. And your site\'s page cache - a caching plugin, your host, or a CDN - which FotoGrids can ask to skip a page but cannot control.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The Share block is selected, but social sharing is turned off site-wide. Turn it on under FotoGrids → Settings → Sharing for the share buttons to show in the lightbox.' => __( 'The Share block is selected, but social sharing is turned off site-wide. Turn it on under FotoGrids → Settings → Sharing for the share buttons to show in the lightbox.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The Show all button appears automatically when the gallery has more photos than the featured image and grid can show. It opens a full-screen grid of every item.' => __( 'The Show all button appears automatically when the gallery has more photos than the featured image and grid can show. It opens a full-screen grid of every item.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The acceleration curve the transition follows.' => __( 'The acceleration curve the transition follows.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The browser rearranges the items the page already contains. Nothing is requested and no cache can affect it, but the selection cannot change. Use this only when <strong>Display Mode</strong> is set to <strong>Show All Items</strong> - with <strong>Break into Pages</strong>, or on a Single Item layout, the same items appear every visit in a different order.' => __( 'The browser rearranges the items the page already contains. Nothing is requested and no cache can affect it, but the selection cannot change. Use this only when <strong>Display Mode</strong> is set to <strong>Show All Items</strong> - with <strong>Break into Pages</strong>, or on a Single Item layout, the same items appear every visit in a different order.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The fields this gallery shows, in the order they appear. Only fields the image actually carries are rendered.' => __( 'The fields this gallery shows, in the order they appear. Only fields the image actually carries are rendered.', 'fotogrids' ),
	'The info panel won\'t appear in the lightbox until you add at least one block above.' => __( 'The info panel won\'t appear in the lightbox until you add at least one block above.', 'fotogrids' ),
